# <type>(<optional-scope>): <subject — imperative mood, ≤72 chars>
#
# Allowed types:
#   feat      new user-facing capability
#   fix       user-facing bug fix
#   refactor  internal restructuring with no user-facing change
#   test      adding tests or improving the test harness only
#   docs      documentation only — README, acceptance doc, plan doc, CHANGELOG
#   chore     tooling, build, CI, scripts, .gitignore, editorconfig
#   perf      measurable performance improvement
#
# Example:
#   feat(pipeline): add deterministic hash-checked resume
#
# Body — explain *why*, not *what*. Wrap at 72 columns.
#
# Footer — references, breaking-change notes (BREAKING CHANGE: ...).
# Lines starting with # are ignored by scripts/check-commit-msg.mjs.
